<title>THAILAND: Advance Info taps $93 million loan.</title>
<headline>Advance Info taps $93 million loan.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thai telecommunications firm Advance Info  Service Plc has taken a three-year $93 million loan from BA Asia Ltd  and Svenska Handelsbanken AB, the company said on Friday.</p>
<p>The loan costs are six months LIBOR plus unspecified annual fees,  the company said.</p>
<p>The proceeds will be spent on the purchase of new equipment from Ericsson  Thailand Ltd, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
